andconditions\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h3>Terms &amp; Conditions</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<ul class=\"my-custom-list\">\n    <li>This offer is valid from 15 September to 30 September 2026.</li>\n    <li>The maximum number of Reward Miles that can be purchased is 200,000 Miles.</li>\n    <li>The minimum number of Reward Miles that can be purchased is 1,000 Miles.</li>\n    <li>Reward Miles are non-refundable.</li>\n    <li>Reward Miles and Bonus Miles will be credited to the member’s account within 24 hours.</li>\n    <li>This offer is applicable only to Reward Miles purchases.</li>\n    <li>\n    <strong>\n    All\n    <a href=\"https://www.saudia.com/help/useful-links/legal-and-terms-and-conditions/terms-and-conditions?sc_lang=en&amp;sc_country=SA\">\n    AlFursan terms and conditions\n    </a>\n    apply.\n    </strong>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div></span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}